{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Keeper of the Enchanted Books who enters the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, purge them of monsters with a magic pen, and leap into the well to plunge even deeper into hidden depths bound by forgotten spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1748428778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a magic pen with found scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1748428778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s in the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First 2 bosses to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creating your own gun with 40+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlocking new items and upgrading the hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels with unlimited replay value to test synergies!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716400?t=1748428778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/9c7318e5873b8807337bc70329e28c13a800bf64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748428778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/2bc29f5be403a8f7b499a24518b14b4b2b986a37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748428778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/2bc29f5be403a8f7b499a24518b14b4b2b986a37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748428778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Keeper of the Enchanted Books who enters the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, purge them of monsters with a magic pen, and leap into the well to plunge even deeper into hidden depths bound by forgotten spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1748428778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a magic pen with found scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716400/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1748428778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s in the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First 2 bosses to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creating your own gun with 40+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlocking new items and upgrading the hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li><li><p clas